* topology file for CG polymers
*
* Date: Oct 8, 2026
* Author: Shanlong Li
*
   20    1

! bead types for methacrylate polymers
! masses are the sums of the atoms mapped into each bead
MASS   601 MMA   41.073   ! A: methacrylate backbone, CH2-C(CH3)
MASS   602 MAO   58.036   ! B: ester, C(=O)-O-CH2
MASS   603 NC4   73.139   ! C: quaternary ammonium, CH2-N+(CH3)3
MASS   604 BZ1   39.057   ! D: CH2 + ipso/ortho ring carbons, C3H3 (as A1F of Phe)
MASS   605 BZ2   26.038   ! E: ring carbons, C2H2 (as A2F/A3F of Phe)

! bead types for PEG/PEO
MASS   606 PEG   44.000   ! EO unit, -CH2-O-CH2-


!! polymers
! QDM: quaternized DMAEMA monomer, for qPDMAEMA and qPDMAEMA-r-PBzMA
! BZM: 2-phenylethyl methacrylate monomer, for qPDMAEMA-r-PBzMA
! PEG: EO unit of polyethylene glycol (PEG) or polyethylene oxide (PEO);
!      bead name EO kept from the original HyRes definition
! bead names: BB for the backbone bead, SC1, SC2, ... for side-chain beads;
! avoid the HyRes/iCon atom names (N, H, C, O, P, NA-ND, MG) that
! FFs.buildSystem selects by name


AUTOGENERATE
DEFA FIRS NTER LAST CTER

RESI QDM          1.00
GROUP
ATOM BB   MMA     0.00
ATOM SC1  MAO     0.00
ATOM SC2  NC4     1.00
BOND BB   SC1     SC1  SC2     BB   +BB
ANGL BB   SC1  SC2
ANGL -BB  BB   +BB


RESI BZM          0.00
GROUP
ATOM BB   MMA     0.00
ATOM SC1  MAO     0.00
ATOM SC2  BZ1     0.00
ATOM SC3  BZ2     0.00
ATOM SC4  BZ2     0.00
BOND BB   SC1     SC1  SC2     BB   +BB
BOND SC2  SC3     SC2  SC4     SC3  SC4
ANGL BB   SC1  SC2
ANGL SC1  SC2  SC3     SC1  SC2  SC4
ANGL -BB  BB   +BB


RESI PEG          0.00
GROUP
ATOM EO   PEG     0.00
BOND EO   +EO
ANGL -EO  EO   +EO

END
